    "detailed_description": "A mysterious book has sent Clara to another world and she must now find her way home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile Dunmakia Kingdom looks to be a calm place, powerful forces are on the move,<br />\r\naiming to make big changes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the world and enjoy the adventure in this turn based rpg with light puzzle elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story has a lighthearted tone and the estimated playtime to the end is three and a half hour for the easy ending.<br />\r\nI had a lot of fun making the game so I hope some of it rub off.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArrow keys to move/select option <br />\r\nC/Enter to confirm<br />\r\nX/Esc to cancel/bring up game menu<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPress f1 for options menu and check the \u201csmooth mode\u201d for a better experience.<br />\r\n( Warning pressing f12 sends you back to the main menu directly )",
